    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Don’t miss this opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom terraced home, recently renovated to a modern standard throughout. This home is ideally located in Swords Town Centre with all amenities on your doorstep. The accommodation extending to 82 sq.m. comprises entrance hall, guest toilet, living room and kitchen/dining room. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and the family bathroom. There is a front garden with driveway for off street parking and a good sized private rear garden. Oaklands Avenue is a mature and sought after development in the heart of Swords, enjoying easy access to Dublin Airport, Airside retail park, Malahide, M1 and M50 motorways. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n* Immaculate condition\r\n* Town Centre Location with all amenities on your doorstep\r\n* Front garden with driveway for off street parking\r\n* Mature, sought after location\r\n* No management fees\r\n* Downstairs guest toilet\r\n* Low maintenance private rear garden\r\n* Modern fully tiled bathroom\r\n* Modern hi-gloss kitchen fitted\r\n* Modern double-glazed windows & doors throughout \r\n* Electric storage heating\r\n* Walking distance to Swords Main Street, Pavillions Shopping Centre, Schools, Swords Business Park and Bus routes including Dublin Bus & Swords Express \r\n* Easy access to Malahide, Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways\r\n* Within close proximity to Fingallians GAA Club, Balheary Park, Swords Town Park, Malahide Rugby Club and Swords Sailing & Boating Club \r\n* Schools within walking distance: \r\nSt Colmcilles Primary Schools \r\nThe Old Borough National School \r\nHoly Family Junior & Senior National Schools \r\nLoreto College Secondary School \r\nColaiste Choilm Secondary School \r\nFingal Community College"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance hall   -   Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest wc   -   1.5m x 0.8m\r\nTiled floor and part tiled walls. Toilet and sink. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nLiving room   -   4.9m x 4.0m\r\nLaminate flooring. Feature fireplace with open fire.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room   -   3.2m x 4.9m\r\nFully fitted hi-gloss modern kitchen with wall and floor tiling. Integrated electric hob & oven.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding   -   Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   4.4m x 2.9m (front left)\r\nDouble room with laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   3.2m x 2.9m (rear)\r\nDouble room with laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3   -   3.4m x 2.0m (front right)\r\nSingle room with laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   2.2m x 1.9m\r\nModern fully tiled bathroom with walk-in shower, Toilet and sink with Storage. Heated towel rail. Window.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\t\r\nTo the front there is a concrete driveway for off street parking. The good-sized private rear garden is complete with patio tiles and steel shed."
      },
